  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study - Youth entrepreneurship in fragile states - Follow-up 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general aim of this research project is to investigate the role of youth entrepreneurship in uncertain and fragile settings for the Future of Work, focusing specifically on the use of digital solutions. The world is changing rapidly and is requiring us to deal with uncertainty and fragility like pandemics and conflict. These developments have accelerated the use of digital solutions in the workforce and required people to become increasingly flexible in how they reach theirorganizational and social goals. Understanding how youth entrepreneurship plays a part in dealing with this uncertainty and fragility through digital innovation can provide insight into new ways of creating opportunities for youth and to support the impact they are making.</narrative>
  </description>
